}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af3\loch\f9\fs20 \uc1\u-3913?\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs20{\pntxtb \uc1\u-3913?}}{\b\dbch\af3\loch\f3\fs48\cf2 Key Idea:}{\dbch\af3\loch\f3\fs48\cf2  Always keep enough "altitude" (resources) to recover from two independent mistakes.}{\dbch\af5\loch\f5\fs48\cf2 \par 
