}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af3\loch\f9\fs20 \uc1\u-3913?\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs20{\pntxtb \uc1\u-3913?}}{\b\dbch\af3\loch\f3\fs48\cf2 Setup:}{\dbch\af3\loch\f3\fs48\cf2  Service requires to handle 10,000 req/sec,\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li1170\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af3\loch\f9\fs20 \uc1\u-3913?\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs20{\pntxtb \uc1\u-3913?}}{\dbch\af3\loch\f3\fs48\cf2 It would need 34 nodes without considering redundancy for failures. \par 
