}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li1170\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af3\loch\f9\fs20 \uc1\u-3913?\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs20{\pntxtb \uc1\u-3913?}}{\b\dbch\af3\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 Example:}{\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf2  Imagine having a backup generator stored in your garage, but the only way to access the garage is through an electric-powered door that doesn\'92t work during a power outage. Similarly, in the world of services, dependencies between failures and solutions can impact availability. \par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af3\loch\f9\fs20 \uc1\u-3913?\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs20{\pntxtb \uc1\u-3913?}}{\b\dbch\af3\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 Lesson:}{\dbch\af3\loch\f3\fs56\cf2  Ensure that backup systems can be activated even during failures, avoiding failure loops.}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs48\cf2 \par 
