}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f4\fs40 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f8\fs36\cf2 Layered Failures Are Tricky}{\dbch\af2\loch\f8\fs36\cf2 \par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s4\li2250\fi-360\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li1710\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f4\fs36 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnfs36{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f8\fs36\cf2 Identifying dependencies isn\'92t obvious.\par 
