}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f4\fs56 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnfs56{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 Primary system: 5 computers }{\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 (4 identical running the same software, 1 independent).\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f4\fs56 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnfs56{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf3 Main process on all computes during critical parts}{\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 :\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s4\li2250\fi-360\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li1170\fi0 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnfs56{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 4 computers received the same data }{\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 and performed the same calculations.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s5\li2790\fi-360\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li1710\fi0 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnfs56{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 If one computer differed, it was voted out and shut down as it was }{\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 uncorrect}{\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 . }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 (winners rule}{\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 , loses terminate)\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s5\li2790\fi-360\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li1710\fi0 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnfs56{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f3\fs56\cf2 The shuttle could operate with 3 computers and land safely with 2.\par 
