}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s1\li540\fi-540\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li0\fi0\qc {\b\dbch\af3\loch\f3\fs48\cf1 Case Study: Space Shuttle Redundancy}{\b\shad\f1\fs72\cf1 \par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs40 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 The }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 Space Shuttle\'92s computer system}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2  used redundancy to ensure safety and reliability:\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f4\fs40 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 4 identical computers}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2  ran the same software and performed identical calculations. If one failed, the others continued without interruption.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f4\fs40 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 1 independent backup computer}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2  ran different software to double-check the main system\'92s results.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs40 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 During }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 critical operations}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2  like launch and landing, all four main computers processed the same data simultaneously.\line The shuttle could safely }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 operate with three}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2  and even }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 land with two}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2  working computers.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\cf4\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs40 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 This redundancy-based design ensured }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 30 years of missions}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2  without any }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 life-threatening software failures}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2  \'97 a remarkable achievement in aerospace engineering.\par 
